    <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="f-614" contextRef="c-17">&lt;p&gt;Alaska Energy and Resources Company, a Holding Company, owns 100% of the Capital Stock of Alaska Electric Light and Power Company.&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
