        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-191_43104_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource">Original value: N</link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-241_43105_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource">The Snettisham Purchase Power Agreement (PPA) is accounted for as a capital lease on a prospective basis beginning July 1, 2014. Regulatory accounting is applied resulting in an expense pattern consistent with the amount allowed for rate-making purposes. The monthly offsets to this account are to Accumulated Depreciation Snettisham Capital Lease (108.6) and Snettisham Capital Lease (227.01).</link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-290_43102_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource">See note 1 (a) and 1 (o) to Financial Statements.</link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-319_43125_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span class="fontstyle0">Parent company - Alaska energy and Resources Company (AERC) paid in capital for construction of Lake Dorothy Hydroelectric Project$6,771,451.Reclass Retained Earnings due to acquisition of AERC by Avista Corp and recording of Goodwill $83,920,404.Adjustment for pre-merger (Jul 1, 2014) cumulative excess earnings for FERC project 2307 per section 10(d) of the Federal Power Act andpre-merger income taxes ($1,469,216).</span><br style="font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: normal; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal" /><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-506_43103_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource">As a result of the acquisition of Alaska Energy and Resources Company and its subsidiary, Alaska Electric Light and Power Company by Avista Corporation, the Snettisham Purchase Power Agreement (PPA) is accounted for as a capital lease on a prospective basis beginning July 1, 2014.  Regulatory accounting is applied resulting in an expense pattern consistent with the amount allowed for rate-making purposes.  The classification of expenses on the income statement has not changed.  The monthly offsets to the regulatory asset are to Accumulated Depreciation Snettisham Capital Lease (108.6) and Snettisham Capital Lease (227.01)</link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1314_43126_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span class="fontstyle0">The debt issuance expense of the Series 2014 First Mortgage Bonds will be amortized over the life of the bonds through August 2044.</span> <br style="font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: normal; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal" /><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1317_43124_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span class="fontstyle0">The $75.0 million issued under Series 2014 First Mortgage Bonds is bullet debt with entire face value due at maturity.</span> <br style="font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: normal; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal" /><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1321_43128_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>The debt issuance expense of the Series 2025A First Mortgage Bonds will be amortized over the life of the bonds through July 2030.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1323_43127_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>The $20.0 million issued under Series 2025A First Mortgage Bonds is bullet debt with entire face value due at maturity.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2189_43130_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>This plant is automated and is used for standby generation.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2189_43132_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>This plant is automated and is used for standby generation.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2189_43133_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>This plant is automated and is used for standby generation.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2189_43129_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>This plant is automated and is used for standby generation.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2189_43131_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>This plant is automated and is used for standby generation.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2312_43134_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>The size of the penstock limits the maximum power out of Salmon Creek to 5 MW. Installed capacity is 8.5 MW. Project capacity is 5 MW.</p></link:footnote>
